OSF has a ten-volume set of documentation, running the gamut from
user-guide to programmer's reference, published by Prentice-Hall.
But more likely what you want is the O'Reilly and Associates book
"Understanding DCE" by Rosenberry, Kenney, and Fisher.
ISBN 1-56592-005-8

This is a nice book, with enough high-level material to 
get you started, and enough techical details to let you know
how it actually works.  Recommended.
-- 
